      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تزاحفوا</span></b>  <i>They drew near, one to another, in
fight.</i> (IDrd, Z, K.) <i>They walked,</i> or <i>marched,
one to,</i> or <i>towards, another;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ازدحفوا</span></b> .
(TA.)

